      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْبِعٌ</span></b>  One <i>whose camels come to the water on
the seventh day</i> [<i>counting the day of the next
preceding watering as the first</i>]. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  A
slave <i>finding a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَبُع</span> [or <i>rapacious animal</i>] <i>among
his sheep,</i> or <i>goats.</i> (Aboo-Sa'eed Ed-Dareer, S.)

